infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title One query per category vs one grouped pivot
  desc Same report on a 12M-row orders table — table scans are the cost
  compares
    - label One query per category
      children
        - label 3 sequential table scans
          desc One Seq Scan per status (paid, pending, cancelled)
        - label ~2.4 s total
          desc 3 × 800 ms, run back-to-back
        - label Cost grows per column
          desc A 7-status pivot = 7 full scans
    - label One grouped pivot (FILTER)
      children
        - label 1 table scan, all columns
          desc Each column's condition tested as rows stream by
        - label ~850 ms total
          desc ~2.8× faster on the same data
        - label Cost flat in columns
          desc A 7-status pivot = 1 scan
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
